                    <p id="auth-brand-address" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="ph-fill ph-map-pin text-amber-400"></i> Karangsono Krajan 09/01 Mranggen Demak • Buka 09.00 – 21.00 WIB
